'''Purple Candy''' is an {{Epic}} item obtained mainly by killing [[Mobs]] during the [[Spooky Festival]], among other related sources.

== Obtaining ==
=== Spooky Festival ===
While the [[Spooky Festival]] is active, killing [[Mobs]] has a {{Green|10%}} chance to grant {{Item|Green Candy}}. This can be increased up to nearly {{Green|100%}} with [[Green Candy#Spooky Festival|various modifiers, shown here]].

When obtained, there is a base {{Green|10%}} chance of it being a Purple Candy instead. This conversion chance is increased with the following bonuses, which is also not affected by {{Stat|Magic Find}}:
