For example, a {{MobSprite|Ghost}}, which is {{Lv|250}}, grants an additional {{Green|+50%}} chance. When combined with the base {{Green|10%}} conversion chance and the upgrades listed above, this results in a {{Green|68%}} conversion chance.

Without any bonuses to {{Item|Green Candy}} or '''Purple Candy''' chances, that means {{Item|Green Candy}} has a {{Green|10%}} obtaining chance, and {{Item|Purple Candy}} has a {{Green|1%}} obtaining chance.

